let personalDraft={};
function personalPage(){if(!items.length)return pageHero('Personal shopping','Your basket is empty','Select stationery before preparing a WhatsApp enquiry.')+'<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><a class="btn dark" href="#stationery">Browse stationery</a></div></section>';const value=n=>esc(personalDraft[n]||'');return pageHero('Personal shopping','Check price and availability','A short enquiry for home and personal stationery purchases.')+`<section class="section"><div class="wrap personal-layout"><form id="personal-enquiry"><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label for="personal-name">Your name *</label><input id="personal-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" value="${value('name')}" required maxlength="100"></div><div class="field"><label for="personal-area">Town / suburb *</label><input id="personal-area" name="area" value="${value('area')}" required maxlength="150"></div><div class="field"><label for="personal-method">Delivery preference</label><select id="personal-method" name="method">${['Delivery — please quote','Collection — please confirm availability'].map(x=>`<option ${personalDraft.method===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field full"><label for="personal-notes">Anything else? (optional)</label><textarea id="personal-notes" name="notes" maxlength="500">${value('notes')}</textarea></div></div><p class="help">Prices, stock, selling units, delivery or collection and payment arrangements must be confirmed with Lepetse. This is not checkout and no order is placed.</p><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Review WhatsApp message</button><div id="personal-preview" aria-live="polite"></div></form><aside class="basket-summary"><h2>Your items</h2><ul>${items.map(x=>`<li>${esc(x.description)}<br><strong>${esc(x.quantity)} × ${esc(x.unit||'unit to confirm')}</strong></li>`).join('')}</ul><a class="text-link" href="#basket">Edit basket</a><p class="help">Quantities refer to the listed ordering units. Individual items inside a pack cannot be assumed available separately.</p></aside></div></section>`}
function bindPersonal(){const form=document.getElementById('personal-enquiry');if(!form)return;form.oninput=()=>{personalDraft=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));document.getElementById('personal-preview').replaceChildren()};form.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;personalDraft=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));const text=['Hello Lepetse, please confirm price and availability for my personal stationery enquiry.','',...items.map(x=>`${x.description}: ${x.quantity} × ${x.unit||'unit to confirm'}`),'',`Name: ${personalDraft.name}`,`Area: ${personalDraft.area}`,`Preference: ${personalDraft.method}`,personalDraft.notes?`Notes: ${personalDraft.notes}`:'','Please confirm the total, applicable VAT, availability, delivery/collection and payment arrangements.'].filter(Boolean).join('\n');const url='https://wa.me/27794404142?text='+encodeURIComponent(text);document.getElementById('personal-preview').innerHTML=`<h2>Review your message</h2><pre class="whatsapp-message">${esc(text)}</pre><a class="btn dark" href="${esc(url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WhatsApp to send</a><p class="help">WhatsApp opens with this message. Review and press Send there. Nothing has been sent by this website; your basket is kept.</p>`}}
